      "postID": "5c5dbb67e736e74a8adc8630",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 4
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5c5dbb67b6844a0ecfb6b1c2|full_name}: you cant just \"decrease\" polygons from a model in the client for people, thats not how polygons work\n\n72k polys is extremely generous and more than enough to have high detail models, anything higher like 500k that you suggested is overkill and wouldnt add much detail as you get diminishing returns",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
